    "part_notes": "Material: 6082-T6-FRG-CR-1 PER TM-2005. Material standard: TM-2005. Scale: 1:1. General tolerance: ASME Y14.5-2009. Projection: third angle. Heat treatment: none specified. Coating: none specified. General notes: INSPECTION: MUST BE FREE FROM DETRIMENTAL SEAMS, COLD SHUTS, LAPS, EXCESSIVE SCALE, SCALE POCKETS, OR DEFECTS WHICH MAY AFFECT FUNCTION OR TEND TO WEAKEN THE PART UNDER STRESS OR FATIGUE.. PROCESS: TRIM OR GRIND FLASH SMOOTH. MAX EXTENSION OR STEP OF 0.89mm PERMISSIBLE. BLEND RADII AND AVOID STRESS RISER CRACKS, NOTCHES, ETC.. DEBURR: BREAK ALL SHARP EDGES 0.5 MAX.. -CAD IS MASTER- FOR ANY DETAIL NOT SHOWN SEE CAD MODEL. MATERIAL VOLUME: 151901 mm³.",
    "overall_complexity": "moderate"
  },
